  "slug": "lost-girl",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/2629_lost-girl.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "A little girl was crying by the side of the road. A police officer came over and asked, “What’s wrong, little one?”",
    "Through her tears, the little girl said, “I want to go home, but I don’t know the way.”",
    "The officer asked, “What’s your daddy’s name?”",
    "The little girl said, “Darling!”",
    "The officer asked, “What’s your mommy’s name?”",
    "The little girl said, “Baby!”"
  ],
  "english_full": "A little girl was crying by the side of the road. A police officer came over and asked, “What’s wrong, little one?”\n\nThrough her tears, the little girl said, “I want to go home, but I don’t know the way.”\n\nThe officer asked, “What’s your daddy’s name?”\n\nThe little girl said, “Darling!”\n\nThe officer asked, “What’s your mommy’s name?”\n\nThe little girl said, “Baby!”",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Малы́шка пла́кала у борта доро́ги. Полице́йский подошёл и спра́шивает: «Что с тобо́й, малы́шка?»",
    "Сквозь слёзы малы́шка ска́зала: «Я хо́чу верну́ться домой, но не зна́ю путь.»",
    "Полице́йский спра́шивает: «Како́е у твоего́ па́пы и́мя?»",
    "Малы́шка ска́зала: «Дорого́й!»",
    "Полице́йский спра́шивает: «Како́е у твоей ма́мы и́мя?»",
    "Малы́шка ска́зала: «Бе́би!»"
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Malýshka plákala u borta dorógi. Policéyskiy podoshól i spráshivet: «Chto s tobóy, malýshka?»",
    "Skvozʹ slyózy malýshka skázala: «Ya khóchu vernútʹsya domóy, no ne znáyu putʹ.»",
    "Policéyskiy spráshivet: «Kakóye u tvoyegó pápy ímya?»",
    "Malýshka skázala: «Dorogóy!»",
    "Policéyskiy spráshivet: «Kakóye u tvoyey mámy ímya?»",
    "Malýshka skázala: «Bébi!»"
  ],
